# Backend URL used when Vite builds for production (npm run build).
# The build-android-prod.ps1 script overrides VITE_API_URL via -ApiUrl flag,
# so you don't need to edit this file for each build — just pass the URL.
#
# ─── MODE 1: ANDROID STUDIO EMULATOR ─────────────────────────────────────────
# 10.0.2.2 always routes to the host machine's localhost inside the emulator.
# VITE_API_URL=http://10.0.2.2:5000
#
# ─── MODE 2: PHYSICAL ANDROID DEVICE (same Wi-Fi) ────────────────────────────
# Use your machine's LAN IP (run `ipconfig` → IPv4 Address).
# Current LAN IP: 192.168.1.13
# VITE_API_URL=http://192.168.1.13:5000
#
# ─── MODE 3: DEPLOYED PRODUCTION (Render / Railway / etc.) ───────────────────
# Replace with your actual deployed backend URL after deploying.
VITE_API_URL=https://medifind-api.onrender.com
